## StudioCar AI — Local environment.
##
##   cp .env.example.local .env.local
##
## Everything runs on your machine: Docker PostgreSQL, MinIO, ElasticMQ, the
## image worker, and fake Google and phone sign-in. Those settings are
## repository-owned defaults (packages/config/src/local-infrastructure.ts), so
## nothing else belongs here. No Google, MSG91, or AWS account is needed.
##
## Fake Google signs in as developer@studiocar.local. Fake phone sign-in sends
## no message and accepts the code 1234.
##
## See docs/environments.md.

APP_ENV=local

## The one real external service: remove.bg performs the background removal.
REMOVEBG_API_KEY=
